Title: WebSocket Rules
Status: CANONICAL

- STOMP 1.2 over native WSS; no SSE, no SockJS, no permessage-deflate. (ADR-0003/0004, R42)
- Client -> `/app/v1/commands/**`, `/app/v1/queries/**`.
- Server -> `/user/exchange/amq.direct/gafi.v1.(control|events|artifacts)`.
- Contract-first; no handler without AsyncAPI/JSON Schema.

